{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83e\uddf1 Block Pile \u2014 Stack It, Smash It! \ud83c\udfaf</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Let\u2019s build, throw, and get a high score!</strong><br><i>Block Pile</i> is a fun and colorful game. It is easy to play and fun for everyone!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd79\ufe0f How to Play</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>STACK</strong> \u2014 Put blocks on top of each other. Be careful, don\u2019t let them fall!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THROW</strong> \u2014 Throw the ball to hit the blocks. Aim well!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MATCH &amp; SCORE</strong> \u2014 Hit same-color blocks to get more points!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf1f Game Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Easy Controls</strong><br>Tap and play! Anyone can try!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Big Combos</strong><br>Hit blocks of the same color to make cool combos!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play Again and Again</strong><br>Try to beat your high score every time!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nice Look and Sound</strong><br>The game is colorful, and the music is happy!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fun for All</strong><br>Great for kids, families, and anyone who likes puzzle games.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855840/extras/cba5ad5d86a86adafcefaa5fe9c6581d.poster.avif?t=1753081662\" width=800 height=632 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855840/extras/cba5ad5d86a86adafcefaa5fe9c6581d.webm?t=1753081662\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855840/extras/cba5ad5d86a86adafcefaa5fe9c6581d.mp4?t=1753081662\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3855840?t=1753081662","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855840/7d1efda3c84d03c336d6963c31164b89ef6a5695/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1753081662","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855840/0eb4800b9d7e94964b5da6dd9074f257932ae360/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753081662","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855840/0eb4800b9d7e94964b5da6dd9074f257932ae360/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753081662","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83e\uddf1 Block Pile \u2014 Stack It, Smash It! \ud83c\udfaf</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Let\u2019s build, throw, and get a high score!</strong><br><i>Block Pile</i> is a fun and colorful game. It is easy to play and fun for everyone!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd79\ufe0f How to Play</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>STACK</strong> \u2014 Put blocks on top of each other. Be careful, don\u2019t let them fall!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THROW</strong> \u2014 Throw the ball to hit the blocks. Aim well!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MATCH &amp; SCORE</strong> \u2014 Hit same-color blocks to get more points!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf1f Game Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Easy Controls</strong><br>Tap and play! Anyone can try!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Big Combos</strong><br>Hit blocks of the same color to make cool combos!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_para